  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T K.103 describes the construction, characteristics, ratings and application examples of surge protective components (SPCs), having one or two silicon PN junctions, intended for the protection of exchange and outdoor equipment, subscriber or customer equipment and telecommunication lines from surges. The PN junction technologies covered are: Zener breakdown, avalanche breakdown, fold-back, punch-through and rectification.</abstract>
